            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "尾递归优化：对较长的一侧先递归，较短的一侧改为循环（避免栈溢出，Go 编译器会自动做）"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "3-way partition（Dijkstra）：当大量重复元素时，将等于 pivot 的元素一次性划出（Dutch National Flag），可从 O(n log n) 退化为 O(n) 排序"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
